        <item>
            <title>0.8.10</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 15:29:23 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.8.10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.8.10</h2>
<ul>
<li>Arrange the Compass itself: right-click its hub → gear, then drag the four menu portals to trade places — your layout decides which arrow key and which swipe direction opens which menu, and it sticks</li>
<li>New: copy a link, open the menu, enter arrange — a ready-made pill appears at the screen&#x27;s top-right corner. Notion links become real Notion pills (they open as a new tab in the Notion app); other links become website pills. Drag it into a slot, onto a folder, or onto an occupied pill (the occupant moves to its alternative spot)</li>
<li>Right-click editing now reaches the outer (alternative) pills in folder menus</li>
<li>Fresh installs start with swipe-down opening the app-specific Context menu (Window moves to the right)</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
